&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo (part of DoorDash)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo, part of the DoorDash group, is building the leading local commerce platform, connecting consumers, merchants, and couriers in real time. Paris is one of our most strategic and complex markets globally, with unmatched density, brand concentration, and competitive intensity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we move towards our &lt;strong&gt;2026 ambition&lt;/strong&gt;, we are evolving our commercial organisation to match the scale and sophistication required to win in Paris. This includes increased seniority, clearer regional ownership, and stronger execution across Inner and Outer Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Client Partner – Paris Inner Ouest&lt;/strong&gt; role is a newly strengthened position, designed to combine &lt;strong&gt;strategic partner leadership, regional ownership, and organisation building&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Client Partner, you&#39;ll lead a team of Account Management Lead, Senior Account Manager and Account Manager and you will report to the Regional Director of Paris, part of the Commercial team. The position is based in Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are accountable for the &lt;strong&gt;growth and performance of strategic brand portfolios&lt;/strong&gt; across one of Paris’ most critical zones. You will act as the &lt;strong&gt;senior commercial owner&lt;/strong&gt; for your territory, ensuring alignment between Paris-wide strategy and local execution. Beyond partner management, this role plays a central part in &lt;strong&gt;aligning the organisation to business challenges and ambitions&lt;/strong&gt;. You will design, lead, and continuously evolve the account management setup to ensure the right level of seniority, coverage, and execution quality across the territory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;senior leadership role &lt;/strong&gt;with direct impact on revenue, partner satisfaction, and team development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Lead Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Execution Excellence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end growth of brand portfolios within your Paris Inner cluster&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure 5★ account management standards across the team, with clear portfolio sizing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain relationships with senior and C-level stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead contract negotiations, renewals, and upsell strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create and execute joint business plans addressing partner growth, profitability, and operational performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, providing insights on Deliveroo capabilities, competitors, and market trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for a commercial initiative for Paris : engage team, drive performance and proactively adjust structure, focus, or processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Regional &amp;amp; Portfolio Ownership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own a zone cluster, defining and executing the strategy to win&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate Paris-wide and national priorities into clear, actionable regional strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve Client Value Proposition (CVP) across the territory in collaboration with other commercial departments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Talent Development &amp;amp; Succession&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and develop a team of up to 10 AMs / SAMs, either directly or through mid-management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coach and mentor high-potential talent, building a strong internal succession pipeline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Marketing, Product, Strategy, and Finance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent your portfolio and organisation in Paris and France leadership forums&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence roadmap and prioritisation through structured partner and market feedback&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in commercial, client partnership, or account management roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing &lt;strong&gt;complex, strategic brand portfolios&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading &lt;strong&gt;multi-layered teams&lt;/strong&gt; in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in F&amp;amp;B, Hospitality, Retail, FMCG, or Marketplace businesses preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial acumen (P&amp;amp;L understanding)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and scale&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;organisations and coverage models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, structured, and execution-focused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior, credible, and resilient leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with a bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and driving change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about people development and raising standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll work on some of the most complex and impactful challenges in local commerce. We move fast, value ownership, and believe that strong teams build great outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers &lt;strong&gt;significant scope, visibility, and influence&lt;/strong&gt; in shaping how Deliveroo wins in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is looking for an accomplished sales professional to join our Sales Team. AI is moving from experimentation into production, and this role is an opportunity to break into AI while doing meaningful enterprise selling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, AI Hunter, your job is simple: create new SingleStore customers. You will find companies building AI applications where data access, real-time context, memory, retrieval, or operational scale is becoming a constraint—and turn those challenges into new SingleStore customers. You will own a broad territory, build a majority self-sourced pipeline, create demand in an emerging category, and close greenfield enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true hunting role. You will engage customers before they have a defined project, develop customer-specific points of view, create urgency around business and technical problems, work with technical experts to land first production workloads, and build a measurable new-logo business with broad ownership. The ideal candidate is a measurable enterprise hunter who is competitive, curious, technically credible, resilient, and able to sell business outcomes. Direct AI sales experience is valuable, but proven selling ability and technical curiosity matter more than a narrow “AI seller” title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory strategy for net-new customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect fearlessly across a broad account universe using proactive, persistent outbound, account-based, partner, and market-education motions; stay resilient and effective through rejection and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Form account hypotheses, map the buying center, and earn first meetings with relevant points of view tailored to the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage executive, business, technical, security, and procurement stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead great business-first discovery, connect AI and data challenges to fundable goals, and build quantified ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop champions, multi-thread the buying group, earn executive and economic-buyer access, and maintain stakeholder alignment; own the stakeholder plan, mutual action plan, close plan, value case, stage gates, forecast, and commercial outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles through technical validation, security, legal, procurement, negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions and Forward Deployment Engineers and cross-functional teams to validate technical fit and establish the first production workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate competitive displacement and maintain disciplined activity management, CRM hygiene, reporting, qualification, forecasting, and opportunity management; showcase clear metrics such as pipeline created, meetings, conversion, quota attainment, and new-logo performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be AI fluent: use AI and research tools productively and responsibly while applying judgment, validating outputs, and separating facts from hypotheses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within the assigned territory as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of quota-carrying B2B enterprise software sales experience, ideally selling to large or technically sophisticated organizations; experience in data, cloud, analytics, AI, or adjacent technical domains is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repeated, quantified quota success with clear ownership of new-logo wins and self-sourced pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals involving executives, technical evaluators, security, legal, finance, procurement, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sell measurable business outcomes and build ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency in an adjacent domain such as databases, data infrastructure, analytics, AI/ML, cloud, Kubernetes, developer tools, cybersecurity, observability, or open-source software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong qualification, account planning, forecasting, CRM, negotiation, and deal-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning velocity and coachability, demonstrated through specific behavior change after feedback; ability to explain technical concepts clearly to technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence, customer trust, resilience, intellectual honesty, and excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A., B.S. degree or equivalent in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Fortune 500 or security-sensitive organizations, cloud ecosystems, open-source or consumption-based products, or emerging categories is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all recruitment agencies: SingleStore does not accept agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to SingleStore employees. SingleStore is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with the Company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;SingleStore values individuals for their unique skills and experiences, and we’re proud to offer roles in a variety of locations across the United States. Salary is based on permissible, non-discriminatory factors such as skills, experience, and geographic location, and is just one part of our total compensation and benefits package. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards, including merit increases and annual bonuses. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SingleStore’s salary range for this role is [£140,000 - £230,000]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;For candidates residing in California, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/singlestore-california-recruitment-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;. For candidates residing in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/recruitment-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; EEA, UK, and Swiss Recruitment Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;DODO team&lt;/strong&gt; in the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Platform domain&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to build and maintain the common building blocks of Doctolib&#39;s system with a &quot;Platform as a Product&quot; mindset, abstracting and simplifying complex, critical data infrastructure so that product teams can focus on what matters: building faster, better products for healthcare professionals and patients. You will work closely with 600+ engineers across 70+ teams, owning the vision and strategy for data management products that form the foundation of everything we build.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Working in the product team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. We operate in feature teams within an agile environment, collaborating closely with engineering, design, and business teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Own and align the 2-year vision for data storage at Doctolib, defining which datastore products we build, which we source off the shelf, and how they serve both the monolith and the growing ecosystem of services around it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define the product strategy and roadmap for data management products used by 600+ engineers, spanning multiple datastores (PostgreSQL/Aurora, Kafka, Debezium, Couchbase), file storage, data access, and data lifecycle solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Drive reliability, recoverability, and cost transparency across teams, including SLOs, alert ownership, backup and restore testing, and per-team cost visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define the experience for managing production data for services outside the monolith and for new AI product storage needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Partner with Staff and Senior Staff Engineers to assess the impact of complex architectural decisions, facilitate consensus across diverse viewpoints, and align stakeholders on contested trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Measure and improve engineer satisfaction with data management products, leading projects end-to-end, from problem definition and specs writing to development validation, rollout, and impact follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have at least 5 years of experience in Product Management with direct product ownership, working with developers, leading rituals, and writing specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have extensive experience with technical products and platforms, and a passion for solving complex, large-scale infrastructure challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Can drive change across large engineering organizations, you&#39;re comfortable influencing 600+ engineers across more than 70 teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have proven experience building and launching products in a large-scale, international B2B environment, where moving fast without slowing down feature development is a constant challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are fluent in both English and French (C1 level minimum) and are comfortable working in an international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have an entrepreneurial mindset and the ambition to transform healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;ParentCare Program: Enjoy full salary coverage (100%) during your first month of birth leave and 75% during the second, covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our interview process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Recruiter Interview (45m) - w Maxime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hiring Manager Interview (60m) - w Loïc&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Live-case Interview (90m)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Behavioral Interview (75m)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our &lt;a class=&quot;break-words font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Job details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paris, France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
